    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touhou Project Volume 20  <br>A bullet hell shooter by Team Shanghai Alice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This commemorative 20th installment returns to its roots.  <br>It offers a classic style that lets you enjoy bullet hell shooting in its purest form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the roles of Reimu and Marisa.  <br>Combine the eight unique \u201cAnomaly Stones\u201d to equip yourself and face the anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the unique world and story of Touhou.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Story -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something was happening in Gensokyo.  <br>However, only a few noticed it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only signs of something amiss were<br>the sacred sanctuary at the foot of the mountain, an untouchable place,<br>and the power of the anomalies themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with the power she gained from resolving previous anomalies, she sets out to confront the sacred sanctuary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Player Character -</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miko, a priestess of mutation<br>Hakurei Reimu<br>Race: Human<br>Ability: Mainly flying<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671710/extras/7f53a43e56cc1b2505251e60ce2eea03.avif?t=1755477851\" data-has-big width=800 height=600 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ordinary Wizard<br>Kirisame Marisa<br>Race: Human<br>Ability: Ability to use magic<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671710/extras/53c702c1e931523b075a2c5c72336f1b.avif?t=1755477851\" data-has-big width=800 height=600 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Game System -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a vertical scrolling bullet-hell shooting game.<br>Select the difficulty level, the player character, and the mutation stones to equip.<br>The player can choose to equip main, diffusion, concentration, and support stones.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671710/extras/86018d73f7c061c2b72746127664fbd5.avif?t=1755477851\" data-has-big width=800 height=600 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671710/extras/d25c7fc764a974afd5228cc485ae72de.avif?t=1755477851\" data-has-big width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, only the main mutation stone can be changed, but as you play the game, you will get mutation stones so you can select other stones as well. <br>Each has a different effect, so please try playing with different combinations.<br>For other detailed game systems, please refer to &quot;Manual&quot; on the title screen (or pause screen during gameplay).</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touhou Project Volume 20  <br>A bullet hell shooter by Team Shanghai Alice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This commemorative 20th installment returns to its roots.  <br>It offers a classic style that lets you enjoy bullet hell shooting in its purest form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the roles of Reimu and Marisa.  <br>Combine the eight unique \u201cAnomaly Stones\u201d to equip yourself and face the anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the unique world and story of Touhou.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Story -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something was happening in Gensokyo.  <br>However, only a few noticed it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only signs of something amiss were<br>the sacred sanctuary at the foot of the mountain, an untouchable place,<br>and the power of the anomalies themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with the power she gained from resolving previous anomalies, she sets out to confront the sacred sanctuary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Player Character -</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miko, a priestess of mutation<br>Hakurei Reimu<br>Race: Human<br>Ability: Mainly flying<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671710/extras/7f53a43e56cc1b2505251e60ce2eea03.avif?t=1755477851\" data-has-big width=800 height=600 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ordinary Wizard<br>Kirisame Marisa<br>Race: Human<br>Ability: Ability to use magic<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671710/extras/53c702c1e931523b075a2c5c72336f1b.avif?t=1755477851\" data-has-big width=800 height=600 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Game System -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a vertical scrolling bullet-hell shooting game.<br>Select the difficulty level, the player character, and the mutation stones to equip.<br>The player can choose to equip main, diffusion, concentration, and support stones.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671710/extras/86018d73f7c061c2b72746127664fbd5.avif?t=1755477851\" data-has-big width=800 height=600 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671710/extras/d25c7fc764a974afd5228cc485ae72de.avif?t=1755477851\" data-has-big width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, only the main mutation stone can be changed, but as you play the game, you will get mutation stones so you can select other stones as well. <br>Each has a different effect, so please try playing with different combinations.<br>For other detailed game systems, please refer to &quot;Manual&quot; on the title screen (or pause screen during gameplay).</p>",
